# API Endpoints (Updated):
# Sandbox API: https://api-sandbox.duitku.com/api
# Production API: https://api-prod.duitku.com/api
# NODE_ENV=production for live mode, anything else for sandbox mode

# IMPORTANT: 
# 1. Make sure your merchant code and API key are correct
# 2. Test with sandbox first before switching to production
# 3. New API uses header-based authentication with SHA256 signature
# 4. Jakarta timezone timestamp is required in milliseconds

# Authentication Method:
# - Headers: x-duitku-signature, x-duitku-timestamp, x-duitku-merchantcode
# - Signature: SHA256(merchantCode + " - " + timestamp + " - " + apiKey)
# - No signature in request body anymore
